    "description": {
      "value": "<p data-start=\"2492\" data-end=\"2505\"><em data-start=\"2492\" data-end=\"2505\">(6th Level)</em></p><p><strong>Administrative Pressure:</strong> +1</p><p data-start=\"2507\" data-end=\"2528\"><em data-start=\"2507\" data-end=\"2528\">“Pull the minutes.”</em></p><p data-start=\"2530\" data-end=\"2647\">Once per Soma Break, you may consult the Akashic record and ask the GM one question about <strong data-start=\"2620\" data-end=\"2632\">patterns</strong> (not secrets).</p><p data-start=\"2649\" data-end=\"2658\">Examples:</p><ul data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2772\"><li data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2701\"><p data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2701\">Has something like this happened before?</p></li><li data-start=\"2702\" data-end=\"2737\"><p data-start=\"2704\" data-end=\"2737\">What precedent is being violated?</p></li><li data-start=\"2738\" data-end=\"2772\"><p data-start=\"2740\" data-end=\"2772\">What does the world expect here?</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2848\">You are not uncovering hidden facts—you are reading structural repetition.</p><h3 data-start=\"2850\" data-end=\"2858\">Cost</h3><p data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"2884\">No Civic Charge required.</p><h3 data-start=\"2886\" data-end=\"2898\">Pushback</h3><p data-start=\"2899\" data-end=\"2966\">None. Observation does not ossify narrative. Only enforcement does.</p>",
